From: SAMUHIA Web <info@samuhia.co.ke>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:23:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Connect the SAMUHIA WhatsApp bot (+254 101 716 473) across
 the site, SEO and LLM files

- site.json 'bot' block is the single source for the number; wa.me links generated in lib/data.js
- Footer, home page (callout, CTA column, FAQ), contact, support and 404 pages
- Feature pages (Landlord Watch, House to Rent): WhatsApp button, callout, facts, steps, FAQ
- Plot Yangu, MyChama and Samuhia Payments product pages and matching solution pages: callout + FAQ
- Organization JSON-LD gets a WhatsApp bot ContactPoint; feature Service channel gets serviceUrl/servicePhone
- Markdown twins, llms.txt and llms-full.txt mention the bot
- Support and contact meta descriptions mention the bot
